-- Scenarios built into the data:
--  principal ............ one for the whole school         -> unique
--  vice principal ....... one per stage (primary, intermediate) -> ambiguous until stage is given
--  math, grade 1 ........ class أ and class ب have different teachers -> unique once class is given
--  English, grade 3 أ ... two teachers share the class     -> still ambiguous with full context
--  science, grade 1 ..... nobody assigned                  -> unmatched
--  transport supervisor . nobody assigned                  -> unmatched
--  counselor ............ assignment ended last year       -> unmatched for recent incidents
--  academic supervisor .. one for grade 1, one for grade 3 (primary) -> wizard asks for the grade
on conflict (id) do nothing;
